Build the API with Express (TypeScript on Node.js 24) and the frontend with Vue (TypeScript, built with Vite). The backend serves the API and the frontend build. Store data in SQLite under `./data`.
The backend lives in `backend/` (entry `backend/src/server.ts`, run directly by Node.js 24, dependencies in `backend/package.json`). The frontend is a Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`.
